  triage:notes "FOLLOWUP PASS: AG18-REASSIGN-1 formal fix dispatch executed. arch-ctm delivered canonical send envelope unification on feature/pAG-s18-unify-envelope-handler, resolving the Hard Merge Gate violation. PRIOR STATE (initial_pass): s18 own-diff (03c873fc..70cce097, crates/) = 387 insertions(+), 365 deletions(-) = +22 net LOC, FAILED required <= -100 net LOC gate. CURRENT STATE (followup_pass): s18 own-diff (03c873fc..5d1c8861, crates/) = 542 insertions(+), 664 deletions(-) = -122 net LOC, PASSES required <= -100 net LOC gate. Commit-local delta at 5d1c8861: 18 files changed, 325 insertions(+), 474 deletions(-) = -149 net LOC (matches arch-ctm report). The Hard Merge Gate numeric condition is now satisfied. dispatchReady set to false pending merge-forward through remaining sprint branches (s19-s21) and final CI validation, but the core technical fix is verified." .

